(34, 48, 'Hotel Prabhuleela', 'Hotel Prabhuleela in Bhayandar West offers homestyle vegetarian meals, cozy seating, and quick service. Known for thalis, curries, and rice dishes, ideal for casual dining. Delivery within 5kms  Charges: 10,20,30', 'Arihant Krupa, Opp. Khau Galli, Station Road, Bhayander (West), Thane - 401101', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/xGKCkhnRarYcXAgAA', '2025-07-23 09:35:33', '2025-07-25 14:07:09', '', NULL),
(35, 50, 'Chinese Hub Pure Veg Family Restaurant', 'A pocket‑friendly vegetarian Chinese spot in Mira Road, Mumbai, this modest eatery (Shop 9, New Bharati Tower, Plesant Park) offers quick service and generous portions at around ₹350 for two', 'Shop no 9, Bharati Tower, Pleasant Park, Mira Road - East, Mira Bhayandar, Maharashtra 401107', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/9PvZ62VmtJhR6SEx9', '2025-07-29 07:24:13', '2025-07-30 08:31:10', '', NULL),
(36, 51, 'Ashish Family Bar and Restaurant', 'Ashish Family Bar and Restaurant in Bhayander offers a cozy dining experience with delicious multi-cuisine dishes, refreshing drinks, and a welcoming ambiance perfect for families and friends alike.', 'Sai Yogeshwar Apartment, Navghar Phatak Road, Bhayandar East, Mumbai, 401105', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/iXUBVSG9ZMMAj2Tp6?g_st=ipc', '2025-07-29 11:49:14', '2025-08-06 15:32:36', '', NULL),
(37, 54, 'Kurshid Used Biikes Store', 'Kurshid Used Bike Store in Nallasopara West offers quality second‑hand motorcycles with transparent pricing, reliable servicing, and personalized customer care. Ideal for budget-conscious riders seeking dependable rides and friendly advice.', 'Samel pada, Nallasopara west', '', '2025-07-31 10:28:06', '2025-07-31 10:28:06', '', NULL),
(38, 55, 'Aao Khao Chinese Biryani Pulav', 'Aao Khao Chinese Biryani Pulav – located in Kashimira, Mira Road East – serves flavorful fusion delights of Chinese cuisine with aromatic biryani and pulav. We take party orders also!', 'Shop No.13, Opp Shri Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Statue, Next To Sunrise Hotel, Mira Bhayander Road, Kashimira, Mira Road E.Thane 401107', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/s2z8tja7A6ncD3Kx9', '2025-08-01 13:58:21', '2025-08-01 13:58:21', '', NULL),
(39, 56, 'Shawarmazing', 'Delight in authentic Middle Eastern shawarmas, loaded with juicy meats, fresh veggies, and signature sauces. A perfect spot for bold flavors and satisfying wraps, right in Mira Road (Delivery charges applicable as per location)', 'Shop no. 1 , Mira Plaza , Mira - Bhayandar Rd, Hatkesh Rd, Mira Road East, Thane, Maharashtra 401107', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/CdnnhiyjZviH9X2k8', '2025-08-02 09:34:29', '2025-08-09 01:20:54', '', NULL),
(40, 57, 'Moradabadi and Hyderabadi Famous Chicken Biryani', 'Moradabadi and Hyderabadi Famous Chicken Biryani in Mira Road serves two iconic biryani styles—spicy Hyderabadi and flavorful Moradabadi, cooked with tender chicken, aromatic rice, and rich traditional masalas.', 'Shop 2, New Salasar Orchid CHS, New Green Court Club, Mira Road, Mira Bhayandar, Maharashtra, 401107', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/aBVy1p3vuwwwaAnK7', '2025-08-02 12:47:51', '2025-08-02 14:08:20', '', NULL),
(41, 59, 'Shree Sai Chinese', 'Shree Sai Chinese in Mira Road serves flavorful, affordable Indo-Chinese dishes like noodles, fried rice, and Manchurian. A popular spot for quick, tasty meals with generous portions and fast service. Delivery service available only in 4-5 kilometres.', 'Shop No. 6 Bldg. No 8, Eden Rose, near Cinemax Road, Vagad Nagar, Beverly Park, Mira Road East, Thane, Mira Bhayandar, Maharashtra 401105', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/GZ3yD4yp9yKyWpNA8', '2025-08-07 14:41:13', '2025-08-18 05:44:04', '', NULL),
(42, 60, 'Hyderabad Caterers', 'Hyderabad Caterers in Mumbra specializes in authentic Hyderabadi cuisine, offering aromatic biryanis, flavorful curries, and delectable sweets. We take party orders also to make your special occasions unforgettable.', 'Shop no. 1 , Mira Plaza , Mira - Bhayandar Rd, Hatkesh Rd, Mira Road East, Thane, Maharashtra 401107', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/XAfsWRaip5xGRGQH9', '2025-08-08 22:43:49', '2025-08-09 01:08:32', '', NULL),
(43, 61, 'Testing', 'Hyderabad Caterers in Mumbra specializes in authentic Hyderabadi cuisine, offering aromatic biryanis, flavorful curries, and delectable sweets. We take party orders also to make your special occasions unforgettable.', 'abc 123 virar west', '', '2025-08-09 02:37:41', '2025-08-09 02:37:41', '', NULL),
(44, 62, 'Hotel Aai Saheb Lunch Home', 'Hotel Aai Saheb Lunch Home serves authentic, flavorful Indian meals with homely taste, generous portions, fresh ingredients, and warm hospitality, offering a delightful dining experience for families and food lovers in a welcoming atmosphere.', 'Shop No.4, Jangid Tower, Khau Gali, Next to Canera Bank, Mira Road - East, Thane - 401107.', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/Gn7hcwyBd7kjd3PNA', '2025-08-13 06:23:23', '2025-08-13 06:23:23', '', NULL),
(45, 63, 'The Seven Spices', 'The Seven Spices restaurant offers a delectable journey through diverse cuisines. Enjoy authentic Indian flavors, tantalizing Chinese dishes, and more in a cozy setting perfect for dining with family and friends.', 'Opp. Old Petrol Pump, beside Wood Plaza, Medetiya Nagar, Queens Park, Mira Road East, Mira Bhayandar, Maharashtra 401105', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/qVtzEYKcHn3KZ1BS9', '2025-08-20 15:09:04', '2025-08-20 15:09:04', '', NULL),
(46, 64, 'Taste Special', 'Taste Special Cafe in Mira Road offers a cozy ambiance with delicious multi-cuisine dishes, refreshing beverages, quick service, and friendly staff, making it a perfect spot for casual dining and hangouts. We accept bulk orders for parties and functions on Call.', 'Shop No 07, Ramdev Ritu Height,  JP North Rd, Mira Bhayandar, Mira Road - East, Maharashtra 401107', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/q52wXbWwPvAfg3dX9', '2025-08-22 13:28:00', '2025-08-28 07:20:29', '', 'www.tastespecial.in'),
(47, 66, 'Timeless Fine Dine Restaurant', 'Timeless Fine Dine Restaurant offers an elegant ambiance, exceptional hospitality, and a curated menu blending traditional and modern flavors, creating a memorable culinary experience perfect for families, couples, and special celebrations.', 'Shree Ram Tower MTNL Road, Near DCB Bank, Sheetal Nagar, Sai Baba Nagar, Mira Road East, Mira Bhayandar, Maharashtra 401107', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/pKv6xgL3P8FwAMFA9', '2025-09-09 06:43:57', '2025-09-09 06:43:57', '', ''),
(48, 67, 'Pawan Koliwada - Jangid(Miraroad)', 'Pawan Koliwada Restaurant serves authentic coastal flavors, specializing in fresh seafood, traditional koli-style recipes, and vibrant spices, offering a delightful dining experience that celebrates Mumbai’s rich culinary heritage with warmth and hospitality. This outlet opens at 12 Noon and closes at 3 AM.', 'Shop No.5/6, Jangid Complex, Opp. Akash Ganga, Near Jangid Complex, MTNL Road, Mira Road(E), Thane - 401007', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/P6c3XY8qLiBxEDEW8', '2025-09-09 07:16:54', '2025-09-23 17:24:48', '', ''),
(49, 68, 'Shree Krishna Restrobar', 'Shree Krishna Restrobar combines vibrant ambiance, delicious multi-cuisine dishes, refreshing beverages, and lively entertainment, creating the perfect destination for family gatherings, friends’ hangouts, and memorable celebrations with exceptional food and service.', 'Tara Compound,Western Express Highway,Dahisar Chek Naka,Dahisar East, Tare Compound (Dahisar East), Maharashtra 401107', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/ZbkVJauMbsrS7iW47', '2025-09-09 08:13:23', '2025-09-09 08:13:23', '', ''),
(50, 69, 'Hotel Kalvan House', 'Experience coastal delights at Kalvan House Hotel, Mira Road. Known for its spicy curries, delicious seafood, and homely atmosphere, it’s a must-visit destination for Malvani and Maharashtrian food lovers.', 'Shop No.4, E wing, Development Green Avenue, Near Balaji Hotel, Shanti Park, Mira Road - East, Thane - 401107', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/nyCPMGg54QqLuJja8', '2025-09-17 14:22:14', '2025-09-17 17:06:57', '', ''),
(51, 70, 'Pawan Koliwada - Khougali(Miraroad)', 'Pawan Koliwada Restaurant serves authentic coastal flavors, specializing in fresh seafood, traditional koli-style recipes, and vibrant spices, offering a delightful dining experience that celebrates Mumbai’s rich culinary heritage with warmth and hospitality. This outlet opens at 12 Noon and closes at 11:59 PM', 'Shop No.5/6, Jangid Complex, Opp. Akash Ganga, Near Jangid Complex, MTNL Road, Mira Road(E), Thane - 401007', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/P6c3XY8qLiBxEDEW8', '2025-09-22 21:17:11', '2025-09-23 17:29:40', '', ''),
