(19, 7, 'Santosh', 'santosh@gmail.com', '9876543210', 5, 'Good Services', '2025-04-23 12:33:30'),
(20, 11, 'Sagar Pawar', 'sagar.pawar68@gmail.com', '09004998995', 5, 'Serving Healthy Food', '2025-05-01 19:55:21'),
(21, 11, 'Tanvi Mane', 'sagar.pawar@gmail.com', '09004998995', 5, 'Nice Service', '2025-05-01 19:55:39'),
(22, 11, 'Niraj Sharma ', 'sagar.pawar68@gmail.com', '09004998995', 5, 'Good Taste ', '2025-05-01 19:56:17'),
(23, 11, 'Sakshi', 'santosh@gmail.com', '9876543210', 1, 'Bad ', '2025-05-02 07:36:36'),
(24, 15, 'Naved Shaikh', 'naved@gmail.com', '9876543210', 5, 'Gold Coin has been our go-to restaurant for years! Their Schezwan Fried Rice and Chilli Chicken are unbeatable. The taste is consistently amazing, and the service is always warm. A true gem since 1994!', '2025-05-23 13:04:01'),
(25, 15, 'Priya Shah', 'priya@gmail.com', '9876543210', 5, 'From their crispy Spring Rolls to the rich Butter Chicken, every dish feels like it’s made with love. The staff remembers our orders, and the food quality has never dropped in all these years. Highly recommend!', '2025-05-23 13:04:46'),
(26, 15, 'Rajesh Deshmukh', 'rajesh@gmail.com', '9876543210', 5, 'I’ve been coming here with my parents since I was a kid, and now I bring my own family. Gold Coin’s food is nostalgia on a plate—consistent, delicious, and worth every bite!', '2025-05-23 13:06:09'),
(27, 16, 'Mangesh Shetty', 'mangesh@gmail.com', '9876543210', 5, 'The fish thali was absolutely delicious! Fresh, flavorful, and great value for money. I’ll definitely come back with my family.', '2025-05-24 11:32:21'),
(28, 16, 'Priyaka Patil', 'priya@gmail.com', '9876543210', 5, 'Authentic taste and homely vibe! The neer dosa with chicken sukka is a must-try. Service is quick and courteous too.', '2025-05-24 11:33:00'),
(29, 16, 'Javed Shaikh', 'javed@gmail.com', '9876543210', 5, 'A hidden gem in Mira Road! The Mangalorean dishes took me back home. Loved the hygiene, portion size, and taste. Highly recommended!', '2025-05-24 11:33:40'),
(30, 4, 'Sagar Pawar', 'sagar.pawar68@gmail.com', '09004998995', 1, '', '2025-05-28 12:54:21'),
(31, 15, 'Sagar Pawar', 'sagar.pawar68@gmail.com', '09004998995', 1, '', '2025-05-28 12:54:51'),
(32, 17, 'Ritika Sharma', 'Ritika@gmail.com', '9876543210', 5, 'Absolutely loved the authentic flavors! Every dish tasted homemade and fresh. Swadisht Rasoi has become our go-to for family dinners!', '2025-06-01 10:59:26'),
(33, 17, 'Anil Verma', 'anil@gmail.com', '9876543210', 5, 'The ambiance is cozy, the service is warm, and the food is simply delicious. Highly recommended for anyone craving real Indian taste!', '2025-06-01 11:00:18'),
(34, 17, 'Pooja Mehta', 'Pooja@gmail.com', '9876543210', 5, 'From starters to desserts, everything was perfect. Great value and fantastic vegetarian options. Will definitely visit again!', '2025-06-01 11:00:54'),
(35, 4, 'Zayn Shaikh', 'zaynshaikh9223@gmail.com', '8451912522', 5, 'Amazing food and taste', '2025-06-09 12:32:21'),
(36, 20, 'Rajesh Mehta', 'rajesh@gmail.com', '9876543210', 5, 'Absolutely love the South Indian breakfast here! Fresh, tasty, and always served hot. A must-visit for vegetarian food lovers in Bhayandar.', '2025-06-11 12:29:02'),
(37, 20, 'Neha Kulkarni', 'Neha@gmail.com', '9876543210', 5, 'Clean place, polite staff, and delicious thali meals. Perfect for a peaceful family lunch. Great value for money too!', '2025-06-11 12:29:34'),
(38, 20, 'Amit Shah', 'Amit@gmail.com', '9876543210', 5, 'Tried their Chinese dishes and was pleasantly surprised. Pure veg, yet full of flavor. Highly recommended!', '2025-06-11 12:30:01'),
(39, 22, 'Amit Shah', '', '', 5, 'Tried their Chinese dishes and was pleasantly surprised. Pure veg, yet full of flavor. Highly recommended!', '2025-06-12 12:14:48'),
(40, 22, 'Neha Kulkarni', '', '', 5, 'Clean place, polite staff, and delicious thali meals. Perfect for a peaceful family lunch. Great value for money too!', '2025-06-12 12:17:47'),
(41, 26, 'Inayat Shaikh', 'inayat.shaikh09@gmail.com', '09819411026', 5, 'One of the best restaurant and bar services in Mira rd, really liked the vibes and the ambience', '2025-06-23 06:07:23'),
(42, 25, 'Rohit Sharma', 'rohit@gmail.com', '9876543210', 5, 'Prime Fast Food is my go-to place for quick snacks and juices. The food is always fresh, tasty, and served with a smile. Great value for money too!', '2025-06-24 13:02:43'),
(43, 25, 'Priya Shah', '', '', 5, 'Love the crispy fries and fresh fruit juices here! The place is clean, service is fast, and everything tastes amazing. Perfect for evening hangouts with friends.', '2025-06-24 13:04:01'),
(44, 30, 'Mahesh', '', '', 5, 'The ambiance is amazing—feels like dining on a movie set! The food is equally fantastic, especially their tandoori starters. A perfect spot for family dinners and celebrations.', '2025-06-24 13:23:47'),
(45, 30, 'Kavita', '', '', 5, 'Great theme, great food! The Bollywood vibe adds fun to the experience. Loved their biryani and Chinese dishes. Service was quick and friendly. Will definitely come back!', '2025-06-24 13:24:04'),
(46, 31, 'Rahul Mehra', '', '', 5, 'Best place in Bhayandar for tasty Chinese food! The Schezwan noodles and crispy chicken are always delicious. Quick service and pocket-friendly prices make it my regular hangout.', '2025-06-24 13:42:36'),
(47, 31, 'Pooja Shah', '', '', 5, 'I love the spicy flavors at Bijay Chinese Corner. Their manchurian and fried rice are top-notch. Great quality and taste for the price!', '2025-06-24 13:42:52'),
(48, 32, 'Ravi Shetty', '', '', 5, 'Absolutely love the food here! Fresh, tasty, and perfectly spiced. Shree Krishna Pure Veg has become our go-to for family dinners.', '2025-06-25 15:59:27'),
(49, 32, 'Neha Patil', '', '', 5, 'Amazing South Indian and Punjabi dishes! The staff is polite and service is quick. Shree Krishna Pure Veg never disappoints.', '2025-06-25 15:59:45'),
(50, 32, 'Anil Gandhi', '', '', 5, 'Clean, affordable, and consistently delicious! From dosas to paneer gravies, everything at Shree Krishna Pure Veg is full of flavor.', '2025-06-25 16:00:03'),
(51, 21, 'Shahid chohan', 'saamiya82@gmail.com', '9820885991', 4, '', '2025-06-26 15:55:45'),
(52, 20, 'Shekar Bangera', '', '7021998095', 5, 'I visited this food centre ..I an so impressed with its cleanliness,good ambience ,parking space and elegant interiors..Food lovers must visit and enjoy tasty food ..This looks to be classy one ', '2025-06-29 16:24:59'),
(53, 20, 'Shekar Bangera', '', '7021998095', 5, 'I visited this food centre ..I an so impressed with its cleanliness,good ambience ,parking space and elegant interiors..Food lovers must visit and enjoy tasty food ..This looks to be classy one ', '2025-06-29 16:25:50'),
(54, 36, 'Manoj Patil', '', '', 5, 'Good food and great place.', '2025-07-01 12:44:45'),
(55, 36, 'Inayat', '', '', 5, 'One of the best restaurant in a vicinity, taste is amazing, staff has been very professional.', '2025-07-02 17:14:03'),
(56, 24, 'Amar ', '', '7741816153', 5, '', '2025-07-03 15:50:46'),
(57, 44, 'Riyaz', '', '', 5, 'Absolutely loved the Muradabadi chicken biryani! Perfectly spiced, tender chicken, and very aromatic. Reminded me of Delhi streets. A must-try for biryani lovers!', '2025-07-16 08:06:32'),
(58, 44, 'Zainab', '', '', 5, 'Great quantity and quality for the price. The flavors are spot on and the biryani is never too oily. One of the best spots in Mira Road!', '2025-07-16 08:07:08'),
(59, 44, 'Rustom', '', '', 5, 'Been ordering here regularly. The taste is always consistent and satisfying. Their raita and chutney make the meal complete. Highly recommended for real biryani fans!', '2025-07-16 08:07:37'),
